<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3456/61  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5183/88  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7032/37  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2556/61  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     31.27/28   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.1285/05  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1525.7/6.7 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     112.83/88  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.5713/63  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4417/32  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.8220/30  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4157/62  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7922/27  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7318/28  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5907/17</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$382.80/383.30</p>
</text>
